        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Mandrake Root\", \"Shades of Deep Purple\"\n- Companies: Deep Purple\n- Places: Hertford, London's Rainbow Theatre\n- Events: 1972 Rainbow Theatre concert, 1975 Guinness Book of World Records listing\n\nFacts:\n- Deep Purple formed in Hertford in 1968.\n- \"Mandrake Root\" is a song by Deep Purple that appears on their debut album \"Shades of Deep Purple\".\n- Deep Purple's 1972 concert at London's Rainbow Theatre led to their listing in the 1975 \"Guinness Book of World Records\" as \"the globe's loudest band\".\n- Deep Purple have sold over 100 million albums worldwide.",
